WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:14.878
It’s project time! Make a treasure hunt in ScratchJr: plan a map, start with the green flag, walk to the treasure, say something when it’s found, test and fix, and share.

2
00:00:15.478 --> 00:00:22.365
Your pirate walks around an island, finds treasure and says something when it’s found.

3
00:00:22.965 --> 00:00:28.548
Draw the island, the treasure and the path with arrows first.

4
00:00:29.148 --> 00:00:35.600
When the pirate finds the treasure, add a say block: “I found it!”.

5
00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.600
Press the flag.

6
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:45.052
If the pirate goes the wrong way, change one block and try again.

7
00:00:45.652 --> 00:00:51.670
Collect both treasures, say “I found it!”, and finish on the star.

8
00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:54.070
Treasure found! Arrr!

9
00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:58.513
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

10
00:00:58.513 --> 00:01:03.661
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
